<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Trucks to set up India operation.</title>
<headline>Volvo Trucks to set up India operation.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The truck unit of Swedish automotive group AB Volvo said on Friday that it will start production in India in the first quarter of 1998.</p>
</text>
